※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4481

※ Two arguments walked together are walked in step: the first of one goes with
※ the first of the other, and there is no first of one to go with a second the
※ other does not have.

@[listable]
fn added(a: u8, b: u8) → u8:
    a + b

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let v: u8⟦3⟧ = ⟦1u8, 2u8, 3u8⟧
    let w: u8⟦2⟧ = ⟦10u8, 20u8⟧
    let s: u8⟦3⟧ = added(v, w)
    s⟦0⟧
